      "product_faq": [
        {
          "question": "Which color and EU size combinations are listed?",
          "answer": "Black: EU 36–48; Light Gray: EU 36–48."
        },
        {
          "question": "What is the upper construction?",
          "answer": "Perforated stitched synthetic-leather panels with a conventional lace-up closure."
        },
        {
          "question": "Which colors are listed on this link?",
          "answer": "Black and Light Gray. Use these two color choices for this link's sample and bulk assortment."
        },
        {
          "question": "What should I check during a sample fitting?",
          "answer": "Try the sample with the socks you intend to wear. Assess toe space, heel fit and the upper closure before setting your bulk EU size assortment."
        },
        {
          "question": "What is the minimum order for the original style?",
          "answer": "The original-style wholesale minimum is 2 pairs. Quantity pricing is shown on this page; custom branding and packaging are quoted separately."
        },
        {
          "question": "How can I arrange a sample?",
          "answer": "Request a sample quotation with your preferred color, EU size and delivery postcode. The quotation includes the sample charge, shipping cost and proposed dispatch schedule."
        },
        {
          "question": "What should I send for a branding or packaging proposal?",
          "answer": "Send your logo artwork, preferred placement, packaging brief and order quantity. We can review the brief for this style and provide a proposal with the applicable minimum, cost and sample process."
        },
        {
          "question": "How can I get a delivered quotation?",
          "answer": "Send the color-size quantities and destination postcode or port, plus any packaging request. The quotation separates product cost from freight and sets out the dispatch plan and estimated transit time for your chosen shipping method."
        }
